134
00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.987
and the high-risk policy is to be created.

135
00:08:45.987 --> 00:08:47.162
Nothing is sent.

136
00:08:47.162 --> 00:08:50.462
Step six groups the
findings: sixteen rules.

137
00:08:50.462 --> 00:08:51.500
Look for these.

138
00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.990
A client secret on Case Triage Blueprint,

139
00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:57.138
and on Correspondence
Drafting's app registration.

140
00:08:57.138 --> 00:09:00.625
Case Triage Blueprint
inherits every Graph role.

141
00:09:00.625 --> 00:09:03.544
Records Search's sponsor
left on October ninth,

142
00:09:03.544 --> 00:09:06.612
and nobody confirmed a new
one by the twenty-sixth.

143
00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:08.363
And the top-priority drift.

144
00:09:08.363 --> 00:09:12.040
Benefits Q and A Agent passes every rule.

145
00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:19.778
Step seven reads the sponsor
fields Chapter 2 recorded,

146
00:09:19.778 --> 00:09:22.553
now filled for all eight A I identities.

147
00:09:22.553 --> 00:09:27.125
Case Triage Agent has carol as both
