155
00:09:53.503 --> 00:09:57.659
Only one identity is checked,
the ordinary service principal,

156
00:09:57.659 --> 00:09:59.941
and no agent identity read is sent.

157
00:09:59.941 --> 00:10:03.130
Both agent policies are
marked not available.

158
00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:11.742
Step nine dry-runs the agent Conditional
Access plan with its approved hash.

159
00:10:11.742 --> 00:10:13.986
It would send exactly one request:

160
00:10:13.986 --> 00:10:18.955
a POST to the beta Conditional Access
endpoint on the cloud's own Graph host,

161
00:10:18.955 --> 00:10:23.042
for the high-risk policy, because
