181
00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.148
and delete the output folders.

182
00:11:50.148 --> 00:11:51.723
The code deletes nothing.

183
00:11:51.723 --> 00:11:54.240
The authors haven't run Lab 2.

184
00:11:57.990 --> 00:11:59.377
The federal requirement.

185
00:11:59.377 --> 00:12:04.765
The guide's A I agents section adds to
